{
  "id": "PRO.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 24",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not thou envious against evil men, neither desire to be with them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For their heart studieth destruction, and their lips talk of mischief.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Through wisdom is an house builded; and by understanding it is established:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And by knowledge shall the chambers be filled with all precious and pleasant riches.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A wise man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "strong; yea, a man of knowledge increaseth strength.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For by wise counsel thou shalt make thy war: and in multitude of counsellors",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "safety.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "too high for a fool: he openeth not his mouth in the gate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that deviseth to do evil shall be called a mischievous person.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The thought of foolishness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sin: and the scorner",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an abomination to men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou faint in the day of adversity, thy strength",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "small.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou forbear to deliver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "drawn unto death, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "those that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ready to be slain;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou sayest, Behold, we knew it not; doth not he that pondereth the heart consider",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? and he that keepeth thy soul, doth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he know",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? and shall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he render to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "every",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man according to his works?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My son, eat thou honey, because",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good; and the honeycomb,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sweet to thy taste:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the knowledge of wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto thy soul: when thou hast found",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", then there shall be a reward, and thy expectation shall not be cut off.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lay not wait, O wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", against the dwelling of the righteous; spoil not his resting place:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For a just",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "falleth seven times, and riseth up again: but the wicked shall fall into mischief.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rejoice not when thine enemy falleth, and let not thine heart be glad when he stumbleth:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
