          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prepare thy work without, and make it fit for thyself in the field; and afterwards build thine house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not a witness against thy neighbour without cause; and deceive",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with thy lips.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say not, I will do so to him as he hath done to me: I will render to the man according to his work.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I went by the field of the slothful, and by the vineyard of the man void of understanding;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And, lo, it was all grown over with thorns,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nettles had covered the face thereof, and the stone wall thereof was broken down.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I saw,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "considered",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "well: I looked upon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it, and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "received instruction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to sleep:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shall thy poverty come",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.24.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.24.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one that travelleth; and thy want as an armed man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.34"
            ]
          }
        }
